    "body": "I keep having to learn that conditional fields I have added in the past have led to some kind of issue that required changing them to always-present fields. I would suggest we make this an always-present field of realms with a default of false.\r\n\r\n> Each realm has an associated \"uses mutable global prototype chain\" (a boolean). It is initially false.\r\n>\r\n> Note: This allows the ShadowRealm global to have a mutable prototype.",
